{"seq":1,"slug":"merge-policy-tiered-segment-sizing","title":"段合并策略与分级合并：merge policy 与段尺寸模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/lucene-elasticsearch-engine-segments-inverted-index/segment-merge-operations/merge-policy-tiered-segment-sizing","wordCount":2656,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"段合并策略与分级合并-merge-policy-与段尺寸模型\">段合并策略与分级合并：merge policy 与段尺寸模型</h1><p>Lucene 的段是<strong>不可变</strong>的：一旦写出，任何字节都不能改。这条约束带来全部查询性能的红利（无锁、可缓存、可 mmap），也带来唯一的债——每次 refresh 产生一个新段、每次删除只留下 tombstone、每次更新是&quot;新段加 tombstone&quot;，段只会越积越多。合并（merge）是偿还这笔债的唯一机制：把若干小段读出来、清掉失效文档、写成一个更大的新段、原子替换旧段。本文讨论的是<strong>合并策略如何选段、段尺寸被谁约束、以及什么条件下合并会变成写放大和磁盘危机的来源</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-不可变段的债务模型\">核心概念：不可变段的债务模型</h2><p>不合并的索引会同时坏在两处。查询侧：一次 <code>_search</code> 要打开该分片上的<strong>每一个</strong>段，段数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 直接线性放大 term dictionary 查找、postings 合并与评分循环的开销，每个段还各自持有 doc values、norms、列存文件的 reader 与内存驻留。存储侧：被删文档和旧版本永远占着字节。</p>\n<p>合并一并解决这两个问题，代价是<strong>重写字节</strong>：读入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个段、写出一段，写出量约等于这 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 段的有效字节之和。所以合并的经济学问题只有一个：<strong>用多少后台 I/O 换取多少段数下降与空间回收</strong>。这个问题由 <code>MergePolicy</code> 回答。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[refresh 产生新的小段] --&gt; B[IndexWriter 持有段集合 N]&#10;    B --&gt; C{MergePolicy.findMerges}&#10;    C --&gt;|选出一组候选| D[MergeSpecification]&#10;    D --&gt; E[ConcurrentMergeScheduler&lt;br/&gt;后台线程执行]&#10;    E --&gt; F[读 k 个段&lt;br/&gt;跳过 tombstone]&#10;    F --&gt; G[写出新段 + 更新 docMap]&#10;    G --&gt; H[IndexWriter 原子替换&lt;br/&gt;旧的 N 个段标记删除]&#10;    H --&gt; B&#10;    C --&gt;|无可合并| I[等待下一次 refresh 或&lt;br/&gt;deletesPctAllowed 触发]\">graph TD\n    A[refresh 产生新的小段] --&gt; B[IndexWriter 持有段集合 N]\n    B --&gt; C{MergePolicy.findMerges}\n    C --&gt;|选出一组候选| D[MergeSpecification]\n    D --&gt; E[ConcurrentMergeScheduler&lt;br/&gt;后台线程执行]\n    E --&gt; F[读 k 个段&lt;br/&gt;跳过 tombstone]\n    F --&gt; G[写出新段 + 更新 docMap]\n    G --&gt; H[IndexWriter 原子替换&lt;br/&gt;旧的 N 个段标记删除]\n    H --&gt; B\n    C --&gt;|无可合并| I[等待下一次 refresh 或&lt;br/&gt;deletesPctAllowed 触发]</pre><p>合并<strong>不是</strong>在 refresh 之后同步执行的，而是 <code>IndexWriter</code> 内部一个持续运行的后台循环，每次有段变化（refresh、flush、上次合并完成）就被唤醒重新求候选集。因此段数在稳态下不是单调下降的——写入速率与合并速率形成一个动态平衡点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"tieredmergepolicy-分级合并的选段规则\">TieredMergePolicy：分级合并的选段规则</h2><p>Lucene 4 之后默认策略是 <code>TieredMergePolicy</code>（取代早期的 <code>LogMergePolicy</code>/<code>LogByteSizeMergePolicy</code>）。名字里的&quot;tier&quot;就是它和日志式合并的核心区别：<strong>日志式合并按大小区间强制对齐</strong>（只允许同量级的段互合并，保证 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 层数），而<strong>分级合并允许跨量级合并</strong>，只要这次合并的&quot;收益分数（score）&quot;足够高。</p>\n<p><code>TieredMergePolicy</code> 的选段逻辑可概括为三步：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>分箱（tiering）</strong>：段按字节从大到小排序并累积，每累积到 <code>segmentsPerTier</code> 个段就切一条分箱线，目的是<strong>避免每次都去动最大的段</strong>。</li>\n<li><strong>打分（scoring）</strong>：对每个分箱内的段组合算 score，倾向于选<strong>总字节小、段数多、且含删除比例高</strong>的组合。删除比例被 <code>reclaimDeletesWeight</code> 加权，因为含大量 tombstone 的合并能顺带回收空间。</li>\n<li><strong>约束过滤</strong>：超过 <code>maxMergedSegmentMB</code> 的合并被拒绝（除非单段本身已超限），低于 <code>floorSegmentMB</code> 的段被视作&quot;相等的最小单位&quot;。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Elasticsearch 把这些参数暴露成动态索引设置，可在运行时用 <code>_settings</code> 调整：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Elasticsearch 设置</th>\n<th>默认值</th>\n<th>对应 Lucene 语义</th>\n<th>调大的后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>index.merge.policy.segments_per_tier</code></td>\n<td><code>10</code></td>\n<td>分箱层宽 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>单次合并更多段，写放大降低但峰值 I/O 抬高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>index.merge.policy.max_merge_at_once</code></td>\n<td><code>10</code></td>\n<td>一次最多选几段</td>\n<td>同上，且受 <code>segments_per_tier</code> 约束</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>index.merge.policy.max_merged_segment</code></td>\n<td><code>5gb</code></td>\n<td>单段尺寸上限</td>\n<td>允许更大合并段，查询更快但单次合并更重</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>index.merge.policy.floor_segment</code></td>\n<td><code>2mb</code></td>\n<td>视作最小单位</td>\n<td>小于此值的段被视为等价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>index.merge.policy.deletes_pct_allowed</code></td>\n<td><code>33.0</code></td>\n<td>触发合并的删除率阈值</td>\n<td>更早回收空间，合并更频繁</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>index.merge.policy.reclaim_deletes_weight</code></td>\n<td><code>2.0</code></td>\n<td>删除回收评分权重</td>\n<td>更偏好含删除的段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>index.merge.scheduler.max_thread_count</code></td>\n<td><code>max(1, min(4, CPU/2))</code></td>\n<td>并发合并线程数</td>\n<td>并行度上升，磁盘争抢加剧</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>（来源：Elasticsearch <code>index-modules</code> 合并设置文档 <a href=\"https://www.elastic.co/guide/en/elasticsearch/reference/current/index-modules-merge.html\">https://www.elastic.co/guide/en/elasticsearch/reference/current/index-modules-merge.html</a> ；Lucene 10.x <code>TieredMergePolicy</code> Javadoc <a href=\"https://lucene.apache.org/core/10_3_0/core/org/apache/lucene/index/TieredMergePolicy.html）\">https://lucene.apache.org/core/10_3_0/core/org/apache/lucene/index/TieredMergePolicy.html）</a></p>\n<p>一个常被误配的组合是 <code>segments_per_tier</code> 与 <code>max_merge_at_once</code> 反向：若把 <code>max_merge_at_once</code> 设得比 <code>segments_per_tier</code> 大，分箱宽度的约束就失效，策略会倾向于一次性吞掉整个分箱，单次合并的字节量失去上界。官方建议 <code>segments_per_tier</code> 应大于等于 <code>max_merge_at_once</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"段尺寸模型的数学-写放大与层数\">段尺寸模型的数学：写放大与层数</h2><p>为什么 <code>segmentsPerTier = 10</code> 是默认值而不是 2 或 100？这可以用写放大直接算出来。</p>\n<p>设稳态下索引有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 个等大段，每段 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 字节，层宽 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>。从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 段合并到 1 段的&quot;金字塔&quot;需要约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>T</mi></msub><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log_T N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2342em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 层，每层都要把该层所有有效字节重写一遍，总写入字节量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>≈</mo><mi>N</mi><mi>s</mi><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>T</mi></msub><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W \\approx N s \\log_T N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2342em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>。摊到原始数据量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Ns</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 上：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>T</mi></msub><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A = \\frac{W}{N s} = \\log_T N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2342em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个式子给出一个实用直觉：<strong>写放大只随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 的对数下降，却随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 的对数上升</strong>。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 从 10 提到 20 只把写放大降一半，代价是单次合并的峰值字节量翻倍——后台 I/O 方差急剧变大，容易在写入高峰撞上磁盘带宽上限。这就是&quot;分级&quot;设计的意义：它不追求写放大的理论最优，而是<strong>用受控层宽换取可预测的单次合并成本</strong>。</p>\n<p>层数反过来决定查询成本。合并后段数大致稳定在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>T</mi><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>T</mi></msub><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(T \\log_T N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2342em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 量级，所以搜索时要打开的 reader 数不是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 而是它的对数级：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>6</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N = 10^6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T = 10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span> 时稳态段数约在几十到几百量级——这正是&quot;refresh 每秒产生一个段、但索引不会因此崩掉&quot;的原因。段产生速率由 refresh 周期决定（见 <code>../1_lucene-segment-write-model/2_write-path-buffer-refresh-flush-translog.md</code>），段越大则 FST 越紧凑（见 <code>../2_term-dictionary-encoding/1_fst-term-dictionary-term-index.md</code>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"删除与去重-deletespctallowed-如何驱动合并\">删除与去重：<code>deletesPctAllowed</code> 如何驱动合并</h2><p>删除在 Lucene 里从不&quot;就地删除&quot;。一次 <code>_delete</code> 或 <code>_update</code> 只在段上追加一个 tombstone（该段内哪些 doc id 已失效），段本身不变。反直觉的后果是：<strong>删除率越高，段越小、越多，查询越慢</strong>——段的有效负载在缩小，而固定开销（reader、FST、列存页）不变。</p>\n<p><code>deletesPctAllowed</code>（ES 默认 <code>33.0</code>，Lucene 侧 <code>DEFAULT_DELETES_PCT_ALLOWED = 33.0</code>）就是这个阈值：当一个段的删除比例超过 33%，该段成为合并的高优先级候选——即便不满足常规尺寸分箱条件，策略也会因为它能回收空间而给高分：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>回收收益</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>合并成本</mtext><mo>≈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{回收收益} = d \\cdot s, \\qquad \\text{合并成本} \\approx (1-d) \\cdot s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">回收收益</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">合并成本</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 是删除比例。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.33</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d = 0.33</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.33</span></span></span></span></span> 时回收约三分之一字节；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 接近 1 时合并几乎全空的段不产生新字节，纯赚。这解释了为什么高频 upsert 的索引（把 <code>_id</code> 当主键反复覆盖写的商品库存索引）在没有显式 force merge 时也能自动收敛。</p>\n<p>要区分的是 <code>expungeDeletes</code>：<code>IndexWriter.forceMergeDeletes()</code>（对应 ES 的 <code>?only_expunge_deletes=true</code>）<strong>只</strong>合并删除率超过 <code>expunge_deletes_allowed</code>（默认 10%）的段，不改变段数目标，适合&quot;删了一大片但不想触发全量重写&quot;的场景。</p>\n<h2 id=\"force-merge-什么时候该做-什么时候是陷阱\">force merge：什么时候该做，什么时候是陷阱</h2><p><code>POST /&lt;index&gt;/_forcemerge?max_num_segments=1</code> 是最常被误用的运维命令。它<strong>强制把段数压到目标值</strong>，代价是重写几乎整个索引。用在正在写入的索引上会有三个后果：后台合并与前台写入争抢 I/O；合并完成后新的 refresh 立刻又产生小段，段数目标瞬间失效；被合并掉的段若被搜索线程持有引用，还会短暂抬高堆内存。</p>\n<p>强制合并正确的场景只有一类：<strong>索引已经不再写入</strong>。典型形态是时序索引（日志、订单快照、月度归档）在 ILM rollover 之后进入 warm/cold 阶段、被设为 <code>index.blocks.write: true</code> 的只读索引（来源：Elasticsearch <code>_forcemerge</code> API 文档 <a href=\"https://www.elastic.co/guide/en/elasticsearch/reference/current/indices-forcemerge.html）。另一个边界：force\">https://www.elastic.co/guide/en/elasticsearch/reference/current/indices-forcemerge.html）。另一个边界：force</a> merge <strong>在分片级别生效，不跨分片</strong>——<code>max_num_segments=1</code> 得到的是&quot;每个分片一个段&quot;，主分片数决定段的最终数量下限。</p>\n<h2 id=\"调度-节流与磁盘水位-合并为什么会被卡住\">调度、节流与磁盘水位：合并为什么会被卡住</h2><p>合并是后台任务，但消耗的是<strong>同一块磁盘</strong>的带宽和<strong>同一个 JVM</strong> 的堆。三层限流决定它能不能跑起来：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>并发度</strong>：<code>max_thread_count</code> 默认取 <code>max(1, min(4, CPU/2))</code>，多数机器上是 2–4 条合并线程；<code>ConcurrentMergeScheduler</code> 的 <code>max_merge_count</code> 默认等于线程数 + 5。</li>\n<li><strong>I/O 节流</strong>：Elasticsearch 7.0 移除了索引级合并节流设置（<code>indices.store.throttle.*</code>），速率控制交还给操作系统与存储层。&quot;合并把磁盘打满&quot;要靠磁盘本身（更高 IOPS 的 SSD、分离的数据盘）而非配置项解决。</li>\n<li><strong>磁盘水位</strong>：<code>disk.watermark.low/high/flood_stage</code> 默认 <code>85% / 90% / 95%</code>。合并需要<strong>临时空间</strong>——写新段时旧段还在，峰值占用可达索引体积两倍以上。到 high 水位分片开始迁移，到 flood_stage 索引被设为只读，<strong>而只读索引上的合并被 <code>index.blocks.write</code> 直接拒绝</strong>，空间回收被自己锁死，形成&quot;磁盘满→只读→不能合并→更满&quot;的死结。给合并预留磁盘的规则因此很直接：<strong>数据盘容量按原始数据体积的 1.5–2 倍估</strong>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"跨境电商索引场景下的合并映射\">跨境电商索引场景下的合并映射</h2><p>把上面的机制映射到几个典型索引，能看出合并参数该不该动：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>索引类型</th>\n<th>写入模式</th>\n<th>合并关注点</th>\n<th>推荐做法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>商品目录（catalog）</td>\n<td>低频更新、高频查询</td>\n<td>段大而少，查询延迟优先</td>\n<td>保持默认；离线窗口做只读 force merge 到 1 段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>库存/价格（upsert 密集）</td>\n<td>高频覆盖写</td>\n<td>删除率长期偏高</td>\n<td>关注 <code>deletes_pct_allowed</code>；不要频繁 force merge</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>订单/日志（时序）</td>\n<td>只追加、按时间滚动</td>\n<td>冷数据空间回收</td>\n<td>ILM rollover → warm 只读 → <code>max_num_segments=1</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>观测先于调参：<code>GET /_nodes/stats/indices/merges</code> 的累计读入字节除以索引体积就是实际写放大；<code>_cat/segments</code> 的删除比例分布能看出阈值是否偏高（大量段卡在 20%–33% 之间说明 <code>deletes_pct_allowed</code> 可适度下调）。段数长期数千、删除比例持续高于 30% 说明合并跑不赢写入速率，第一动作是查磁盘水位和合并线程是否被阻塞。调参优先级固定：<strong>先确认没有被磁盘水位或只读块卡住，再调并发线程数，最后才动尺寸参数</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>把全文压成一条因果链：不可变段让查询免锁、免缓存失效，但把删除和更新转成 tombstone 债务；<code>TieredMergePolicy</code> 用受控层宽 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>T</mi></msub><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log_T N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2342em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的摊薄写放大分批偿还；<code>max_merged_segment</code>、<code>floor_segment</code>、<code>deletes_pct_allowed</code> 三个阈值分别约束单次合并体量上界、最小工作单位与空间回收触发点；并发线程数、磁盘水位与只读块决定这套机制在真实集群里能不能跑得动。Force merge 是这套自动机制的<strong>手动覆盖</strong>，只在索引不再写入时才安全。查完段数、删除比例和写放大三个数字，<code>_forcemerge</code> 该不该敲就不再是经验判断。查询侧如何受益于合并后的段数下降，见 <code>../3_search-scoring-execution/1_bm25-similarity-norms-score-model.md</code>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"段合并策略与分级合并：merge policy 与段尺寸模型","id":"段合并策略与分级合并-merge-policy-与段尺寸模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：不可变段的债务模型","id":"核心概念-不可变段的债务模型"},{"level":2,"text":"TieredMergePolicy：分级合并的选段规则","id":"tieredmergepolicy-分级合并的选段规则"},{"level":2,"text":"段尺寸模型的数学：写放大与层数","id":"段尺寸模型的数学-写放大与层数"},{"level":2,"text":"删除与去重：`deletesPctAllowed` 如何驱动合并","id":"删除与去重-deletespctallowed-如何驱动合并"},{"level":2,"text":"force merge：什么时候该做，什么时候是陷阱","id":"force-merge-什么时候该做-什么时候是陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"调度、节流与磁盘水位：合并为什么会被卡住","id":"调度-节流与磁盘水位-合并为什么会被卡住"},{"level":2,"text":"跨境电商索引场景下的合并映射","id":"跨境电商索引场景下的合并映射"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"相关性调优与打分诊断：rescore、explain、深分页与慢查询定位","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/lucene-elasticsearch-engine-segments-inverted-index/search-scoring-execution/rescore-explain-deep-pagination-diagnosis"},"next":{"title":"force merge、删除文档回收与合并 IO 限流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/lucene-elasticsearch-engine-segments-inverted-index/segment-merge-operations/force-merge-deleted-reclaim-io-throttle"}}